      "writtenOn": "2025-01-22T16:38:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we switched `doPremul` to `noPremul` and uploaded a 1 for cases that don\u0027t want a premul (e.g. doUnpremul and makeOpaque) and a 0 for the premul case, then we get rid of the `1 + ` operation.\n\nI think that this convention leads to some simpler handling in the _srgb specialization\u0027s alpha swizzling.",
